  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LSMS-ISA MALAWI NATIONAL PANEL SURVEY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the quality and policy relevance of agricultural statistics in Malawi by supporting the design and implementation of the nationally representative Third Integrated Household Survey and its Panel Subcomponentcomma emphasizing the production on a regular basis of detailed information on agriculture and the rural economy. The proposed support covers the period 2009-2014. The core objective of this work is to survey households in 2010/11 for the Third Integrated Household Survey (IHS3). The IHS3 sample will be comprised of a cross-sectional sample and a panel sample. The panel households will be re-surveyed in 2013.</narrative>
  </description>
